%% Governance as Code approval flow across stakeholders
graph TD
    Start[Policy Author:<br/>Draft governance update]:::geon-primary
    Start --> Branch[Branch & Commit<br/>to Repository]:::geon-highlight
    Branch --> CI[CI/CD:<br/>Automated tests]:::geon-accent
    CI --> PR[Open pull request]:::geon-accent
    PR --> Review[Governance Review]:::geon-primary
    Review --> Comments{Approved?}:::geon-decision
    Comments -->|No| Changes[Apply changes<br/>& revalidate]:::geon-highlight
    Changes --> Review
    Comments -->|Yes| Merge[Merge to main]:::geon-primary
    Merge --> Deploy[Deploy to<br/>production]:::geon-accent
    Deploy --> Audit[Audit trail<br/>published]:::geon-primary
    Audit --> End[Complete]:::geon-accent
    
    classDef geon-decision fill:#1E3A8A,stroke:#0F172A,color:#F8FAFC,stroke-width:3px
    class Comments geon-decision
